# Production overlay. Vite loads this automatically on a normal
# `npm run build` (Vite's default mode is "production") — no extra
# flag or script needed, unlike staging (see .env.staging.example).
# Copy to .env.production (or .env.production.local to also keep it
# out of git on a machine that builds locally) and fill in the real
# production backend URL. Never commit the filled-in file — already
# covered by the root .gitignore (.env.production) and this app's own
# .gitignore (*.local).

VITE_API_URL=https://api.wazzar.tz
